." Manual page for aero-backup
.TH AERO-BACKUP 1 "November 2026" "Aero Linux v1.4.0" "Aero Linux Manual"
.SH NAME
aero-backup \- Incremental Btrfs snapshot backup and remote synchronization tool
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B aero-backup
[B\-\-sourceR IPathR] [B\-\-targetR IURIR] [B\-\-encryptR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B aero-backup
generates atomic Btrfs incremental streams using btrfs send and receive, transferring encrypted block deltas to local or remote storage targets.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-s ", " \-\-source " " IPathR
Source Btrfs subvolume to snapshot.
.TP
.BR \-t ", " \-\-target " " IURIR
Target backup repository or SSH destination.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Display usage synopsis.
